  "title": "· In Focus | lululemon Teams Up with Artist Geoff McFetridge on a Collaboration Collection: Move More, Find Your Calm ·",
  "original_title": "视野 | lululemon 携手艺术家 Geoff McFetridge 推出合作系列：动一动，心更静",
  "excerpt": "Lululemon and artist Geoff McFetridge launched a collection blending art with running gear to celebrate movement and mental health.",
