      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On September 23, World Mental Health Day, athletic lifestyle brand lululemon teamed up with Canadian artist and ultramarathon runner Geoff McFetridge on a collaborative collection. Titled \"Amplify the Quiet,\" the lineup weaves McFetridge's nature- and runner-inspired artwork into lululemon's performance running gear and everyday apparel, celebrating the bond between movement and art.",
