      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "As an ultramarathon runner, Geoff McFetridge draws both inspiration and energy from movement. \"For me, running amplifies inner quiet,\" he says. \"It stretches the gaps between thoughts, lets still moments expand, and quiets the noise. What this collection conveys is that feeling of a runner lost in their stride, gradually forgetting themselves and merging with the landscape.\"",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/3l9zwnd/06f5224b8be030f3.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/3l9zwnd/7ced063be6de4394.jpg",
      "alt": null,
