    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The collaboration spans several of lululemon's signature lines, including Geoff McFetridge's personal favorite, the fast and free™ running collection. Featherlight Nulux™ fabric pairs with clean tailoring and streamlined storage for a barely-there feel.",
