      "text": "Geoff McFetridge's artwork also appears on everyday pieces like the Big Cozy™ sweatshirt and the French Terry pullover hoodie, as well as accessories ranging from water bottles to belt bags. Playful graphics meet sleek silhouettes, offering more ways to step out in style.",
